<title>CANADA: BMTC Group plans share buyback.</title>
<headline>BMTC Group plans share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BMTC Group Inc said on Wednesday it plans a buyback program under which it may buy back up to 10 percent of its Class A subordinate voting shares and five percent of its Class B multiple voting shares.</p>
<p>The program will run from Friday, April 4 to April 3 next year and be conducted on the Montreal Exchange, the Quebec retailer of furniture and electronics goods said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
